2020-01-01 open Assets:Investments:Broker:ACME
2020-01-01 open Assets:Investments:Broker:XYZ
2020-01-01 open Liabilities:CC:Card
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Food
2020-01-01 open Expenses:Travel
2020-01-01 open Income:Salary
2020-01-01 open Equity:Opening

